<section style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id01286114-810c-11f1-88fc-c715e7e6606c" identifier="/us/usc/t5/s423"><num value="423">§ 423.</num><heading> Pay of Inspectors General</heading><subsection style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0" id="id01286115-810c-11f1-88fc-c715e7e6606c" identifier="/us/usc/t5/s423/a"><num value="a">(a)</num><heading> <inline class="small-caps">Certain Inspectors General.—</inline></heading><paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id01286116-810c-11f1-88fc-c715e7e6606c" identifier="/us/usc/t5/s423/a/1"><num value="1">(1)</num><heading> <inline class="small-caps">In general</inline>.—</heading><content>Notwithstanding any other provision of law, the annual rate of basic pay of the Inspector General of the Intelligence Community, the Inspector General of the Central Intelligence Agency, and the Special Inspector General for Afghanistan Reconstruction shall be that of an Inspector General as defined under <ref href="/us/usc/t5/s401">section 401 of this title</ref>.</content>
</paragraph>
